{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S08、S11、S12等短时段的信息密度明显偏高，纵向交替阅读也不如Y左右分栏省力，容易来不及兼顾文字和音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但【】突出真正影响人物选择的关键心理节点，感受文字又通过到时出现与具体音乐片段建立联系，不只是泛泛地给情绪贴标签。尤其从舍不得旧日亲近、又记得受过的气，到意识到孤独、重新理解自己想念的究竟是什么，再到不再为留住关系牺牲自己，X把人物矛盾的形成和转变交代得更细，前后呼应也更充分。Y更容易快速扫读，但部分音乐感受和心理转折被压缩，人物为什么这样想、为什么发生变化，得到的信息相对少一些。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d4f38016-b961-4c4b-b658-adee240fa233", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T023141042619Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:32:23.376854+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d97fba9d7421db2c23f9d6552ca6baa3b974d87549e898b2f477543a28e8e0e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31